// A method of a class inside a class names a member of the outer class: KIELER's C code looks it up in the chart's data, and gcc fails ('TickData' has no member named 'w').
scchart T {
  class O { int w = 1
    class In { int v = 0
      void inc() { v = v + w } } inn } o
  initial state I go to J
  state J do o.inn.inc() go to K
  state K
}
